1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:02,808
(Penny:)How about we just have
a little quiet time now?

2
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:04,437
(Sheldon:)All right.

3
00:00:05,691 --> 00:00:07,521
[SHELDON WHIMPERS]

4
00:00:09,987 --> 00:00:12,367
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.
I'm finding your reckless nonchalance...

5
00:00:12,531 --> 00:00:15,201
(Sheldon:)...regarding the check-engine light
to be very troubling.

6
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,870
(Penny(Pulling over):)Get out.

7
00:00:22,166 --> 00:00:25,416
(Sheldon:)I have to tell you that while I do have
a theoretical understanding...

8
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:27,336
...of an internal-combustion engine...

9
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:30,175
(Sheldon:)...I'm not sure
I'm capable of performing diagnostics.

10
00:00:30,341 --> 00:00:32,171
I said, "Get out."

11
00:00:32,343 --> 00:00:34,133
(Sheldon:)Okay, I'll give it a shot.

12
00:00:48,818 --> 00:00:50,778
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard, there you are.

13
00:00:50,945 --> 00:00:52,325
(Sheldon:)I'm ready to go home.

14
00:00:54,156 --> 00:00:55,326
(Leonard:)I just got here.

15
00:00:55,491 --> 00:00:57,411
(Sheldon:)Good. Perfect timing.

16
00:00:57,868 --> 00:01:01,328
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I told you, I only have access
to the free-electron laser at night.

